{
  "area": "storage",
  "description": "Ordered operation lists over workspaces read the way saveWorkspace reads its fields: nulls and wrong types as the reference defaults them, the exact project kind, the id as JavaScript trims it, settings and grants that are only kept when non-empty, and the creation time kept across edits. Each case starts from an empty database. Same op and expected rules as ops-chats.json.",
